# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zeon's seeded scaffold — present locally and synced to the robot via
# `zeon sync`, but deliberately NOT in the public git repo: it is the vendor's
# material, not ours, and keeping it out means this repo is 100% our work.
#
# Teammates get the full tree from `zeon clone tacit-teacher` (or the Drive
# copy). Anything WE author in skills/ or workflows/ is still tracked — only the
# seeded items are listed here.
